#. Runtime JSON key: tools.game_control.description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "统一的游戏入口，用于速度、暂停/恢复、游戏状态、存档、DLC启用、sandbox操作和UI操作。使用 domain=ui uiDomain=dialog 读取或确认当前的MOD不匹配对话框。使用语义操作和具名目标；此入口不接受坐标输入。 uiDomain=selection支持按精确id被动读取一名复制人的status，以及显式select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.GAME_CONTROL.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Unified game entrypoint for speed, pause/resume, game state, saves, DLC activation, sandbox operations, and UI actions. Use domain=ui uiDomain=dialog to inspect or acknowledge the current MOD mismatch dialog. Use semantic actions and named targets; coordinate input is not accepted here. uiDomain=selection supports passive status and explicit select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down for one duplicant by exact id."
msgstr "統一的遊戲入口，用於速度、暫停/恢復、遊戲狀態、存檔、DLC啟用、sandbox操作和UI操作。使用 domain=ui uiDomain=dialog 讀取或確認目前的MOD不匹配對話框。使用語意操作和具名目標；此入口不接受座標輸入。 uiDomain=selection支援按精確id被動讀取一名複製人的status，以及明確select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。"

#. Runtime JSON key: tools.game_control.parameters.action
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "所选子系统的游戏操作。domain=speed支持time、pause、resume、set_speed和只读trace。UI feedback支持notification、popup、speech_bubble、marker；uiDomain=dialog支持当前MOD不匹配对话框的status、acknowledge。 domain=save支持list、status、save、load和quit；status只读取已记录的存档模组标签，不会加载存档。 uiDomain=selection支持按精确id被动读取一名复制人的status，以及显式select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。selection的修改操作需要task及confirm=true；dryRun不调用UI。滚动仅针对已选复制人的UI；scroll_up/down各发送一次原生滚轮事件（+1/-1）并返回pending，不保证距离、完成或可见性。后续status或截图需显式请求。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.GAME_CONTROL.PARAMETERS.ACTION"
msgid "Game action for the selected subsystem. domain=speed supports time, pause, resume, set_speed and read-only trace. UI feedback supports notification, popup, speech_bubble and marker; uiDomain=dialog supports status and acknowledge for the current MOD mismatch dialog. domain=save supports list, status, save, load and quit; status only reads cached MOD labels and never loads a save. uiDomain=selection supports passive status and explicit select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down for one duplicant by exact id. Selection UI mutations require task and confirm=true; dryRun invokes no UI. Scroll requires the selected duplicant UI; scroll_up/down dispatches one native wheel event (+1/-1) and returns pending, without guaranteeing distance, completion or visibility. Request a later status or screenshot explicitly."
msgstr "所選子系統的遊戲操作。domain=speed支援time、pause、resume、set_speed和唯讀trace。UI feedback支援notification、popup、speech_bubble、marker；uiDomain=dialog支援目前MOD不符對話框的status、acknowledge。 domain=save支援list、status、save、load和quit；status只讀取已記錄的存檔模組標籤，不會載入存檔。 uiDomain=selection支援按精確id被動讀取一名複製人的status，以及明確select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。selection的修改操作需要task及confirm=true；dryRun不呼叫UI。捲動僅針對已選複製人的UI；scroll_up/down各傳送一次原生滾輪事件（+1/-1）並回傳pending，不保證距離、完成或可見性。後續status或螢幕截圖需明確要求。"

#. Runtime JSON key: tools.game_control.parameters.uiDomain
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "UI子系统：action、feedback、dialog或selection。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.GAME_CONTROL.PARAMETERS.UIDOMAIN"
msgid "UI subsystem: action, feedback, dialog or selection."
msgstr "UI子系統：action、feedback、dialog或selection。"

#. Runtime JSON key: tools.game_control.parameters.dryRun
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "对于支持的操作，预览而不应用更改。uiDomain=dialog action=acknowledge 为 true 时验证当前目标而不调用按钮。其他操作仍遵守各自的预览约定。 selection的select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down只验证现有UI目标，不选择、不关闭、不发送滚轮事件，也不刷新UI。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.GAME_CONTROL.PARAMETERS.DRYRUN"
msgid "For supported actions, preview without applying changes. uiDomain=dialog action=acknowledge validates the current target without invoking its button when true. Other actions retain their own preview contract. selection select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down validates existing UI targets without native selection, close, wheel events or UI refresh."
msgstr "對於支援的操作，預覽而不套用變更。uiDomain=dialog action=acknowledge 為 true 時驗證目前目標而不呼叫按鈕。其他操作仍遵守各自的預覽約定。 selection的select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down只驗證既有UI目標，不選擇、不關閉、不傳送滾輪事件，也不重新整理UI。"

#. Runtime JSON key: tools.game_control.parameters.dialog
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "uiDomain=dialog 的对话框种类。仅支持 mod_mismatch；不能确认其他对话框。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.GAME_CONTROL.PARAMETERS.DIALOG"
msgid "Dialog kind for uiDomain=dialog. Only mod_mismatch is supported; unrelated dialogs cannot be acknowledged."
msgstr "uiDomain=dialog 的對話框種類。僅支援 mod_mismatch；不能確認其他對話框。"

#. Runtime JSON key: tools.game_control.parameters.dialogToken
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "status 返回的当前MOD不匹配对话框的不透明令牌。acknowledge 必填，并在原生调用前重新核对。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.GAME_CONTROL.PARAMETERS.DIALOGTOKEN"
msgid "Opaque token returned by status for the current MOD mismatch dialog. Required for acknowledge and checked again before native invocation."
msgstr "status 傳回的目前MOD不匹配對話框的不透明權杖。acknowledge 必填，並在原生呼叫前重新核對。"

#. Runtime JSON key: ui_dialog.ui_control_description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "UI统一入口：domain=action/feedback/dialog/selection。支持允许的UI Action、玩家反馈、原生对话框status/acknowledge，以及按精确id操作复制人选择的status/select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.UI_DIALOG.UI_CONTROL_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Unified UI entrypoint: domain=action/feedback/dialog/selection. Supports allowed UI actions, player feedback, native dialog status/acknowledge, and exact-id duplicant selection status/select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down."
msgstr "UI統一入口：domain=action/feedback/dialog/selection。支援允許的UI Action、玩家回饋、原生對話框status/acknowledge，以及按精確id操作複製人選擇的status/select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。"

#. Runtime JSON key: ui_dialog.ui_domain_description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "UI子系统：action、feedback、dialog或selection。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.UI_DIALOG.UI_DOMAIN_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "UI subsystem: action, feedback, dialog or selection."
msgstr "UI子系統：action、feedback、dialog或selection。"

#. Runtime JSON key: ui_dialog.ui_action_description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "domain=action：list/trigger/open_management/management_status；management_status仅被动读取screen=schedule。打开schedule需要confirm=true；dryRun不发送UI，observedOpen与操作发送分别返回。domain=feedback：notification/popup/speech_bubble/marker；domain=dialog：status/acknowledge；domain=selection：使用精确id的被动status或显式select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。selection的修改操作需要task及confirm=true；dryRun不调用UI。滚动仅针对已选复制人的UI；scroll_up/down各发送一次原生滚轮事件（+1/-1）并返回pending，不保证距离、完成或可见性。后续status或截图需显式请求。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.UI_DIALOG.UI_ACTION_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "domain=action: list/trigger/open_management/management_status; management_status passively reads screen=schedule. Schedule open requests require confirm=true; dryRun dispatches no UI and observedOpen is separate from dispatch. domain=feedback: notification/popup/speech_bubble/marker; domain=dialog: status/acknowledge; domain=selection: passive status or explicit select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down with exact id. Selection UI mutations require task and confirm=true; dryRun invokes no UI. Scroll requires the selected duplicant UI; scroll_up/down dispatches one native wheel event (+1/-1) and returns pending, without guaranteeing distance, completion or visibility. Request a later status or screenshot explicitly."
msgstr "domain=action：list/trigger/open_management/management_status；management_status僅被動讀取screen=schedule。開啟schedule需要confirm=true；dryRun不傳送UI，observedOpen與操作傳送分別回傳。domain=feedback：notification/popup/speech_bubble/marker；domain=dialog：status/acknowledge；domain=selection：使用精確id的被動status或明確select/close/scroll_up/scroll_down。selection的修改操作需要task及confirm=true；dryRun不呼叫UI。捲動僅針對已選複製人的UI；scroll_up/down各傳送一次原生滾輪事件（+1/-1）並回傳pending，不保證距離、完成或可見性。後續status或截圖需明確要求。"

#. Runtime JSON key: ui_dialog.invalid_ui_domain
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "UI的domain必须为action、feedback、dialog或selection。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.UI_DIALOG.INVALID_UI_DOMAIN"
msgid "UI domain must be action, feedback, dialog or selection."
msgstr "UI的domain必須為action、feedback、dialog或selection。"

#. Runtime JSON key: tools.game_control.parameters.keepPaused
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "确认MOD不匹配后是否保持暂停，默认为true。false保留原生暂停处理，绝不强制恢复。status和dryRun不改变速度。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TOOLS.GAME_CONTROL.PARAMETERS.KEEPPAUSED"
msgid "For MOD mismatch acknowledgement, preserve a paused game after native OK; defaults to true. False leaves native pause handling unchanged and never forces resume. Status and dryRun do not change speed."
msgstr "確認MOD不匹配後是否保持暫停，預設為true。false保留原生暫停處理，絕不強制恢復。status和dryRun不改變速度。"

