#. Runtime JSON key: dupe_move_guidance.instructions
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "<targetQueryToken>应为普通ops scalar或简单引号文本；JSON escape不会解码。需要引号/backslash/控制字符escape的名称，或仅为数值/布尔值的名称，不在此指引保证范围内，请使用坐标batch等。<itemsJson>是JSON数组。task与预行flags须用于外层world_editor请求。预行仅检查语法与capability，不解析移动目标、不检查可达性，也不发出移动指令。执行需要外层confirm=true且dryRun=false、指令行confirm=true，batch的payload也须confirm=true。受理不等于到达。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.DUPE_MOVE_GUIDANCE.INSTRUCTIONS"
msgid "Use an ordinary ops scalar or simple quoted text for <targetQueryToken>; JSON escapes are not decoded. Names needing quote/backslash/control escapes or consisting only of a number/boolean are outside this guide; use coordinate batch instead. <itemsJson> is a JSON array. Supply task and preview flags on the outer world_editor request: syntax/capability checks only, without target resolution, reachability checks or move dispatch. Execution needs outer confirm=true and dryRun=false, command confirm=true and batch payload confirm=true. Acceptance is not arrival."
msgstr "<targetQueryToken>應為普通ops scalar或簡單引號文字；JSON escape不會解碼。需要引號/backslash/控制字元escape的名稱，或僅為數值/布林值的名稱，不在此指引保證範圍內，請使用座標batch等。<itemsJson>是JSON陣列。task與預行flags須用於外層world_editor請求。預行僅檢查語法與capability，不解析移動目標、不檢查可達性，也不發出移動指令。執行需要外層confirm=true且dryRun=false、指令行confirm=true，batch的payload也須confirm=true。受理不等於到達。"

