#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "日程管理。list读取原生时间表信息；仅显式指定includeTimetables时展开所有行。set_block支持dryRun预览及明确的confirm/task，并修改一个原生时段。其他操作保留原有契约。"
#. zh-Hant is a provisional source sample; the existing zh-Hans runtime keeps its separate translation.
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Schedule management. list reads native timetable metadata; includeTimetables explicitly expands all rows. set_block changes one native block with dryRun and explicit confirm/task. Other actions retain their existing contracts."
msgstr "日程管理。list讀取原生時間表資訊；僅明確指定includeTimetables時展開所有列。set_block支援dryRun預覽及明確的confirm/task，並修改一個原生時段。其他操作保留原有契約。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.action
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "list、create、set_block、assign_dupe或optimize。"
#. zh-Hant is a provisional source sample; the existing zh-Hans runtime keeps its separate translation.
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.ACTION"
msgid "list, create, set_block, assign_dupe or optimize."
msgstr "list、create、set_block、assign_dupe或optimize。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.schedule
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "list或set_block使用的准确日程名称，必须唯一匹配。assign_dupe保留原有名称查找。"
#. zh-Hant is a provisional source sample; the existing zh-Hans runtime keeps its separate translation.
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.SCHEDULE"
msgid "Exact schedule name for list or set_block. Names must resolve uniquely; assign_dupe retains its existing name lookup."
msgstr "list或set_block使用的準確日程名稱，必須唯一匹配。assign_dupe保留原有名稱查找。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.hour
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "set_block在timetableIndex行内的时刻0–23；默认仍为第0行。"
#. zh-Hant is a provisional source sample; the existing zh-Hans runtime keeps its separate translation.
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.HOUR"
msgid "set_block local hour 0–23 in timetableIndex; row 0 remains the default."
msgstr "set_block在timetableIndex列內的時刻0–23；預設仍為第0列。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.group
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "set_block使用list返回的原生分组ID（例如Hygene、Worktime、Recreation或Sleep）。"
#. zh-Hant is a provisional source sample; the existing zh-Hans runtime keeps its separate translation.
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.GROUP"
msgid "set_block native group ID from list (for example Hygene, Worktime, Recreation or Sleep)."
msgstr "set_block使用list傳回的原生群組ID（例如Hygene、Worktime、Recreation或Sleep）。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.timetable_index
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "list或set_block使用的时间表行号，从0开始。默认0保留第一行，不会切换原生当前时间表。"
#. zh-Hant is a provisional source sample; the existing zh-Hans runtime keeps its separate translation.
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.TIMETABLE_INDEX"
msgid "Zero-based timetable row for list or set_block. Default 0 preserves the first row; this never changes the native current timetable."
msgstr "list或set_block使用的時間表列號，從0開始。預設0保留第一列，不會切換原生目前時間表。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.include_timetables
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "仅用于list：显式为true时包含全部时间表及其时段。默认false只返回选定行。"
#. zh-Hant is a provisional source sample; the existing zh-Hans runtime keeps its separate translation.
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.INCLUDE_TIMETABLES"
msgid "list only: explicitly include every timetable and block. Default false returns only the selected row."
msgstr "僅用於list：明確為true時包含全部時間表及其時段。預設false只傳回選定列。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.dry_run
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "set_block为true时预览准确的行、时刻及分组，不执行原生写入或通知。其他操作遵循各自的预览契约。"
#. zh-Hant is a provisional source sample; the existing zh-Hans runtime keeps its separate translation.
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.DRY_RUN"
msgid "set_block true previews the exact row/hour/group without native writes or notifications. Other actions follow their own preview contracts."
msgstr "set_block為true時預覽準確的列、時刻及群組，不執行原生寫入或通知。其他操作遵循各自的預覽契約。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.confirm
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "set_block在dryRun=false时必须为true。其他操作保留原有确认规则。"
#. zh-Hant is a provisional source sample; the existing zh-Hans runtime keeps its separate translation.
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.CONFIRM"
msgid "set_block requires true when dryRun=false. Other actions retain existing confirmation rules."
msgstr "set_block在dryRun=false時必須為true。其他操作保留原有確認規則。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.list_description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "读取现有日程信息。blocks默认仍为前24个时段；可指定timetableIndex或显式获取全部时间表。"
