msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.LIST_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Read existing schedule metadata. blocks remains the first 24 by default; select timetableIndex or explicitly include all timetables."
msgstr "讀取現有日程資訊。blocks預設仍為前24個時段；可指定timetableIndex或明確取得全部時間表。"

#. Runtime JSON key: schedule_timetables.set_description
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "设置一个现有原生日程时段。dryRun=true可预览；执行必须提供confirm=true及task。timetableIndex默认为0。"
