msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.SCHEDULE_TIMETABLES.SET_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Set one existing native schedule block. Preview with dryRun=true; execution requires confirm=true and task. timetableIndex defaults to 0."
msgstr "設定一個現有原生日程時段。dryRun=true可預覽；執行必須提供confirm=true及task。timetableIndex預設為0。"

